# Runtime secrets. The pattern is deliberately wide: the literal rule used to be
# "docker/api.env", which did not match docker/api.env.bak-* — so two backups of
# the file, carrying live Stripe and Resend keys, were committed on 2026-08-24
# and only GitHub push protection stopped them reaching the remote.
docker/api.env*
*.env
*.env.bak*

web/landing/*.bak.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
